// Note to translators:
// If a sentence is the same in your language then please change it to "#same"
//
// eg:
// LANG_ENGLISH  "HALT"
// LANG_GERMAN   "#same"
//
// (This is so we can tell which strings have been signed-off as ok to be the same words for QA
//  and because we do not store duplicate strings, which will then get exported again next time
//  as being untranslated.)
//
VERSION             "1"
CONFIG              "C:\trees\cod2\bin\StringEd.cfg"
FILENOTES           "Strings used in Beltot go in this file."

REFERENCE           OBJECTIVE_SECURE
LANG_ENGLISH        "Secure the village of Beltot."
LANG_SPANISH         "Asegura el pueblo de Beltot."

REFERENCE           OBJECTIVE_ELIMINATE
LANG_ENGLISH        "Eliminate enemy mortar teams. [&&1 remaining]"
LANG_SPANISH         "Elimina los morteros enemigos. [&&1 restantes]"

REFERENCE           OBJECTIVE_JOINUP
LANG_ENGLISH        "Join Captain Price at the back of the building."
LANG_SPANISH         "Reúnete con el capitán Price en la parte posterior del edificio."

REFERENCE           OBJECTIVE_BRING_TRUCK
LANG_ENGLISH        "Bring the German truck back to help transport the prisoners."
LANG_SPANISH         "Lleva el camión alemán de vuelta para ayudar a transportar a los prisioneros."

REFERENCE           MISSIONFAIL_KILLPOW
LANG_ENGLISH        "Harming prisoners of war will not be tolerated."
LANG_SPANISH         "Hacer daño a los prisioneros de guerra es inadmisible."


ENDMARKER


